ews","timestamp":"2026-10-06T06:23:36.000Z","text":"Transrail Lighting shares rally 5% after bagging ₹412 crore order in its core T&D business","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"bullish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-06T06:52:05.631Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-06T06:52:05.631Z"},{"id":"news-gn-tX0UyRk1acnFoTWp2bnczbVlIWjBBN2E","source":"news","author":"Moneycontrol.com","handle":"Moneycontrol.com","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-10-06T05:23:50.000Z","text":"Transrail Lighting shares jump 4% after Rs 412 crore order win","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-06T06:52:05.631Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-06T06:52:05.631Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-652946","source":"valuepickr","author":"hirakroy123","handle":"@hirakroy123","community":"Transrail Lighting: T&D play","timestamp":"2026-10-04T07:57:15.971Z","text":"image 1179×1395 166 KB Recently, transrail won an order for HTLS reconductoring project for this D/C line and powergrid has raised its capex. Many reconductoring tenders have already been floated and with TBCB winning multiple projects in various states recently will open doors for HTLS conductors in coming months. Another multiyear growth opportunity for transrail is GEC(III) project recently announced by GOI . Next 4-5 years look attractive for transrail in terms of order pipeline","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/transrail-lighting-t-d-play/180374/85","sentiment":"neutral","likes":2,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-04T12:20:06.797Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-20T19:35:39.306Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-652731","source":"valuepickr","author":"hirakroy123","handle":"@hirakroy123","community":"Transrail Lighting: T&D play","timestamp":"2026-09-30T11:53:11.486Z","text":"Screenshot (256) 1085×834 123 KB Company got its first order for HTLS conductor after commissioning of new plant but the major concern is their order rate per quarter. Company managed to achieve only 1609cr fresh orders as of now whereas their guidance for full year is 10000cr","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/transrail-lighting-t-d-play/180374/84","sentiment":"neutral","likes":4,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-30T12:32:52.994Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-20T19:35:39.306Z"},{"id":"news-gn-a3FiYUE5dlkyQ1pWZFNCNHYyeDE2N0Rn","source":"news","author":"Upstox","handle":"Upstox","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-30T10:16:17.000Z","text":"Transrail Lighting shares rally 10% on securing new orders worth over ₹574 crore; key details","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"bullish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-30T12:32:52.994Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-30T12:32:52.994Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-652217","source":"valuepickr","author":"shreyesh_jain","handle":"@shreyesh_jain","community":"Transrail Lighting: T&D play","timestamp":"2026-09-22T15:38:35.381Z","text":"It’s suspicious about the unsecured loan, but when this was asked in the concall, the company said that the repayment of the loan from Burberry Infra is in line with their FY27 expectations. They also said that they are earning 12% interest on the loan, which is higher than the interest rate at which the company borrows. They also mentioned that ₹31 crore of debt was recently repaid by the Burberry infra. Another suspicious aspect of Transrail is that when you look at the pre-IPO shareholding, there appear to be 3–4 layers between the actual promoters and the listed company.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/transrail-lighting-t-d-play/180374/83","sentiment":"neutral","likes":2,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-22T17:38:10.233Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-20T22:40:15.531Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-652195","source":"valuepickr","author":"hirakroy123","handle":"@hirakroy123","community":"Transrail Lighting: T&D play","timestamp":"2026-09-22T09:31:18.477Z","text":"Seems like market was waiting for the conductor facility to roll out after several delays","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/transrail-lighting-t-d-play/180374/82","sentiment":"neutral","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-22T12:50:08.312Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-20T22:40:15.531Z"},{"id":"news-gn-fTDdqSE9vM1JaS09hQW94aG1SdENZLXc","source":"news","author":"Livemint","handle":"Livemint","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-22T06:39:03.000Z","text":"Transrail Lighting shares surge 13% | Is the pullback set to continue? Experts weigh in","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-22T07:41:56.876Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-22T07:41:56.876Z"},{"id":"news-gn-ZzdXFTZlk3b2ZXODBDVUZZOGFfbU5ZZw","source":"news","author":"Upstox","handle":"Upstox","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-22T06:17:17.000Z","text":"Transrail Lighting shares rally 17% on increasing conductor manufacturing capacity","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"bullish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-22T07:41:56.876Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-22T12:50:08.312Z"},{"id":"news-gn-rZS1kWnd2bkdZTWtIWXlhUTVGenVHcGc","source":"news","author":"Business Standard","handle":"Business Standard","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-22T06:14:50.000Z","text":"Transrail Lighting shares zoom 12% on 70% rise in manufacturing capacity","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-22T07:41:56.876Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-22T12:50:08.312Z"}]}
